=== aarch64-linux-gnu-dwp ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Report bugs to <https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/>


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  aarch64-linux-gnu-dwp [options] [file...]


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  file...


FLAGS (6) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-h, --help         Print this help message
-e, --exec EXE     Get list of dwo files from EXE (defaults output to
                   EXE.dwp)
-o, --output FILE  Set output dwp file name
-v, --verbose      Verbose output
    --verify-only  Verify output file against exec file
-V, --version      Print version number
